# Factories

- `UserFactory.build()` / `buildUser()` — unique user via `@faker-js/faker` + UUID token; no API call.
- `TestUser` is `CreateAccountPayload` — one typed shape for API + UI.
- `UserFactory.create()` — register via API (`assertResponseCode` 201) and `track()` for dispose.
- `UserFactory.track()` / `untrack()` — UI-created users or tests that delete themselves mid-spec.
- `UserFactory.dispose()` — deletes tracked users; fails the suite if delete is not 200/404.
- Emails/passwords must use `uniqueToken()`; never hard-code shared accounts.
- `buildPayment()` — checkout card data (Visa test PAN); pass explicitly from specs/flows.
- `ProductFactory`: cache `productsList`; `defaultSearchTerm()` / `randomSearchTerm()` / `pickRandom()`.
